  "_": "The band's geometry, shared by both previz renderers. previz/src/figure.rs reads this with include_str! + serde_json; ui/src/components/Previz3D.tsx imports it directly. It exists so the two views cannot drift: they used to be independent hand-copies and the web one was still drawing an armless pawn three commits after the native figures grew limbs. Lengths are metres, angles radians, directions need not be unit \u2014 they are normalised on use. Axes: +Y up, +Z downstage toward the audience, +X the figure's own left.",
