  "_meshes": "Body parts, authored at exact segment length and NEVER scaled: a capsule's caps distort under non-uniform scale, and `bone` relies on the cylinder section matching the joint-to-joint distance so the caps overlap at every joint. An overlapping joint cannot leak a pinhole of light through the shadow. Bevy's Capsule3d(radius, length) and three's CapsuleGeometry(radius, height) both mean the CYLINDER section, so these transcribe 1:1.",
